SUMMARY:Restorative Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a class for adults that will provide an opportunity 
 for you to relax through gentle stretching and mindful breathing. This 
 class is designed for anyone who would like to slow down\, connect with the 
 body and calm the mind. Both beginners and experienced yogis are welcome. 
 During the class\, you will be guided through a series of yoga poses and 
 mindful breathing techniques intended to calm the busy mind and stretch the 
 body. Registration is required. \n\nPlease provide your own mat or a 
 towel.\n\nIf you have questions about accessibility\, program stimulation 
 levels\, and/or need disability accommodations\, please contact us at 
 919-560-7192.
LOCATION:Southwest Meeting Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Carmen Ruth":MAILTO:cruth@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Health & Fitness, Sensory Friendly
UID:LibCal-14288-17232308
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17232308
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261021T150000Z
DTEND:20261021T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20261021T000000Z
SUMMARY:Computers Basics
DESCRIPTION:Gain valuable computer skills on these topics:\n\nComputer 
 Basics\n\n\n	Using an operating system\; opening programs\; saving\, 
 copying\, and deleting files.\n\n\nDocuments & Typing\n\n\n	Word processing 
 basics\; editing and saving documents\; formatting text\; cut copy and 
 paste.\n\n\nInternet Basics \n\n\n	Browsing websites\; searching with 
 Google\; using online forms\; keeping accounts secure.\n\n\nOnline 
 Life\n\n\n	Avoiding scams\; protecting your privacy\; finding reliable 
 info\; using social media safely.\n\n\nTo sign up: Call 919-293-1133 or 
 click the link to register below:\n\n\n \n\nClass Sign Up Link\n\n\n
LOCATION:SLW Meeting Room - Side 1\, Stanford L. Warren Branch Library (1201 Fayetteville St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Larry Daniels":MAILTO:ldaniels@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:
