DTSTART:20261021T150000Z
DTEND:20261021T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20261021T000000Z
SUMMARY:Ready\, Set\, Baby Class
DESCRIPTION:This free prenatal breastfeeding education class is designed to 
 help you get ready for your baby\, whether you are a first-time parent or 
 adding to your family. These classes are a great way to prepare for 
 pregnancy\, birth\, and life with a newborn. You’ll get helpful 
 information on breastfeeding\, postpartum care\, and what to expect in 
 those early weeks. Our class is packed with conversations\, resources\, and 
 a raffle prize at the end! Snacks will be provided. Registration required. 
 \n\nThis class will be offered on Thursday\, October 22nd from 11 am–1 pm 
 in Spanish.\n\n
LOCATION:Bragtown Branch Library (3200 Dearborn Dr)
ORGANIZER;CN="Felicia Brown":MAILTO:felbrown@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Classes & Lectures
UID:LibCal-14288-17654219
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17654219
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261021T160000Z
DTEND:20261021T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20261021T000000Z
SUMMARY:Flexible Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Join our community book club! Whether or not you've had a 
 chance to read the book\, we welcome everyone to participate. Our 
 discussion questions are broad\, so anyone can join the conversation. We 
 explore a wide range of genres—from historical fiction and romance to 
 mystery and non-fiction—ensuring there's something for everyone. The 
 Flexible Book Club is a fantastic way to connect with fellow book lovers in 
 the Durham community and share your passion for reading!\n\nThe selection 
 for this session is The Book of Joy: Lasting Happiness in a Changing World 
 by Dalai Lama and Desmond Tutu.\n\nEmail cruth@dconc.gov or call 
 919-560-8648 for more information.
LOCATION:Southwest Meeting Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Carmen Ruth":MAILTO:cruth@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Book Club, Low Sensory Stimulation
UID:LibCal-14288-17232310
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17232310
END:VEVENT
