SUMMARY:Storytime at Jireh Family Farm *Off-Site*
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special storytime on the farm at Jireh Family 
 Farm! Bring the whole family to enjoy interactive stories\, action songs\, 
 and finger plays\, all while spending time with other little ones while out 
 and about in your community!\n\nIntended ages: 0-5 years old\n\nLocation: 
 1310 N. Mineral Springs Rd. Durham\, NC 27703\n\nNOTE: Storytime is free 
 and open to all\, but other optional farm activities (listed below) will 
 have a fee. \n\nMore information on Jireh Family Farm: Pasture-Raised Meat 
 & Eggs | Jireh Family Farm\, Durham NC
