DESCRIPTION:Join us for a workshop on Heartfulness Meditation. The session 
 will cover how to listen to your heart\, how to achieve your goals\, and 
 how to understand the real key to success. This workshop is designed for 
 adults from all backgrounds and belief systems.\n\nPlease register online. 
