SUMMARY:Romance Lovers Book Club- Zomromcom and Ladies in Hating
DESCRIPTION:Love stories have a way of bringing people together! Join the 
 Romance Lovers Book Club to explore a variety of romance novels while 
 connecting with fellow readers in a welcoming and engaging environment. 
 Each month\, we'll read and discuss two different romance titles\, 
 featuring a range of subgenres such as contemporary\, historical\, 
 mystery\, fantasy\, and more. Together\, we'll chat about memorable 
 characters\, compelling storylines\, favorite tropes\, and the themes that 
 make each book unique. Whether you're a longtime romance reader or looking 
 to discover the genre for the first time\, all are welcome. Come share your 
 love of reading\, enjoy thoughtful conversation\, and leave with new book 
 recommendations and new friends.\n\nThis month we're reading\, Zomromcom by 
 Olivia Dade and Ladies in Hating by Alexandra Vasti. If you want to attend 
 this virtual event\, please register or contact Chelsea Romero at 
 cromero@dconc.gov with any questions. \n\nThis program will be held 
 virtually on October 28\, 2026\, at 6:00 p.m. Once you register for the 
 event\, you will receive a Zoom link!
LOCATION:Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="Chelsea Romero":MAILTO:cromero@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Book Club
