 in this month's Maker   STEAM Take and Make! Paint a 3D printed page 
 holder\, enjoy a warm beverage\, and peruse several reading resources with 
 this kit for you to take home.\n\nKits are located in the shelving unit 
 outside of the Innovation Lab on the Third Floor at Main Library for you to 
 take home and complete.\n\nFirst come\, first serve while supplies last.\n
