SUMMARY:A Matter of Balance
DESCRIPTION:An award-winning program designed to reduce the fear of falling 
 in older adults age 55  and increase their activity levels as they age. 
 Join us for an 8-week workshop if you have a fear of falling or are worried 
 you might as you age.
