SUMMARY:Small is All Productions Presents: Circle & Square @ Stanford L. Warren
DESCRIPTION:Join Small is All Productions for Circle and Square\, a play 
 designed for ages 2-5 and their parents/caregivers to attend and enjoy 
 together. In this interactive\, mostly nonverbal story\, audiences meet the 
 free spirit Circle\, followed by highly structured Square. These two 
 characters have a hard time figuring out how to play together because they 
 are so different. Throughout the play\, Circle and Square discover each 
 other's unique gifts and how they can be combined to have even more fun 
 together than apart.\n\nRegistration required - registration will open 3 
 weeks before the event. Questions? Please call 919-560-0270 or email 
 Natalia at nltrujillo@dconc.gov. \n\nThis program is sponsored by the 
 Durham Library Foundation.\n\n \n\nIf you have questions about 
 accessibility\, program stimulation levels\, and/or need disability 
 accommodations\, please contact us at 919-560-0270. \n\n\n\n
LOCATION:SLW Meeting Room - Full Room\, Stanford L. Warren Branch Library (1201 Fayetteville St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Kristen Stockdale":MAILTO:kstockdale@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Story Time
