SUMMARY:Tabletop Troupe - Board Games & Card Games
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Tabletop Troupe!\n\nThis is a club for ages 9 - 18 
 who like all things board games\, card games\, and TTRPGs.\n\nEach 
 meeting\, we'll be learning how to play a new game\, and we will have open 
 games for anyone to walk in and play.\n\nRegistration is optional for a 
 reminder email.\n\nFeedback Form\n\n \n\nThis program is made possible by a 
 donation from the Friends of the Durham Library. \n\nNew games were 
 purchased through Guildhall Games\, a local game & toy store in Boxyard RTP 
 committed to providing a safe and welcoming space for underrepresented 
 communities in the area.
