 kstockdale@dconc.gov or call (919) 560-8592. \n\n \n\nNote: Based on the 
 vote results from April's book club meeting\, we will begin reading the 
 Baby-sitters Little Sister series\, part of the BSC universe\, in June! 
 \n\nAugust: Baby-sitters Little Sister: Karen's Worst Day\n\nSeptember: 
 Baby-sitters Little Sister: Karen's Kittycat Club\n\nOctober: Baby-sitters 
 Little Sister: Karen's School Picture\n\nNovember: Baby-sitters Little 
 Sister: Karen's Birthday \n\n \n\n \n\nIf you have questions about 
